<v Ira Glass>WBEZ管理监督由Torey Malatia先生负责，他谈到了自己在公共广播电台之前的那些年。

00:57:55.150 --> 00:58:01.130
<v Eli>Oh yeah, what I did was a bad thing, and I don't suggest anybody else do it because that would be wrong.
<v Eli>哦，是的，我做的是件坏事，我不建议别人也这样做，因为那是错误的。

00:58:01.130 --> 00:58:57.170
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life . Until then, I'll dedicate this song to you.
<v Ira Glass>我是Ira Glass，下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。在那之前，我把这首歌献给你们。

